    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Emcees fall back",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "It's Vik' in your ear with the whole ball of wax",
          "rhyme": "aks",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Call or fax for the freshest rhyme delivery",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Or takeout, for the fake-you-out ballers in the industry",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Boss with the Lee jeans, bad man, you know V",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "They say he's a cross between Adnan Khashoggi",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "And Sho Kosugi, he said your chain is sure dookie",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "The piece is like a mystery entity, eh, spooky",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "What's its worth? A gun or a knife slice",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Catch a bus once or twice or run for your life price",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "An arm and a leg, the lead is ghetto red hot",
          "rhyme": "Ot",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Calm 'til we fled the spot or leg arm head shot",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCCDCCCEEFG",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABBCBBBBBDE"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You on the battlefield with lyrical militants",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Know he's feelin' bent when he see little pink elephants",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Never forget, memorize the elements",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Keep the mic sterilized, terrorize with eloquence",
          "rhyme": "#s",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "And mellow eyelids, tell no lies, kids",
          "rhyme": "id",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "These guys ask 'em what's their shelltoe size is",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Shields up dumb dumb, where we come from",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "We thump it out for fun, and that's no conundrum",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Pick a bone goon, it's V with the sicker known show tunes",
          "rhyme": "yn",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "On a full moon, lick your own wounds",
          "rhyme": "wndz",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Lighten up the stratosphere, shootin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Slugs is nameless, aim caressin' Vladimir Putin",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "His matted hair was too thin to cut into a gumby",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Nothin' to V, he feel his bum knee",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "It's about to rain, there goes my two-way",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Out of range, it's a strange new day, touché",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "It's all good like down home-cookin'",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "He left with the crown on his dome and kept bookin'",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "His men run Crooklyn",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Keep 1 in 10 huns hookin', no offense, none tooken",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "It's more funner than lookin'",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "The pound of the war drum had your poor son shooken'",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Sometimes he feel he need to stop juxin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Then he say \"nah\" with a real sly crook grin",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Vik's style of rhyme will bug out Joe Sixpack",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Slick while the time he dug out your chick's back",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "She wore a thong in her youth",
          "rhyme": "ut",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "These days she's a bit long in the tooth",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Part II: Titty Fat",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AAABCDEEFGHHIIJJKKHLKLHHMMNOP",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AAAABCDDEFGGBBHHBBGCBCGGIIJKI"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Just chewin' on the titty fat",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Pursuin' the kitty cat, droolin' on her pretty hat",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Playing pool and pitty-pat, stay in school kiddies, brats",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Instead of spraying tools and shitty gats",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Layin' cool, where they at?",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Same jewels as silly rats rulin' with gritty stats",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Coolin' where the cliques be at",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "It's no time for chitty chat, fool V pity that",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Follow your instincts",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "I told her time and time again not to swallow pink drinks",
          "rhyme": ")k",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "I guess it's just how the hollow link clinks",
          "rhyme": ")k",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "V, the fink who made the chink in the mink wink",
          "rhyme": "ink",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "They say he need a shrink",
          "rhyme": ")k",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "On the brink to pipe it when her sink made his pinky stink",
          "rhyme": "ink",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Instead, he asked her for some paper and some ink",
          "rhyme": "ink",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Could have flipped it longer 'cept the beat was rather rinky-dink",
          "rhyme": "ink",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Still workin' out the kinks",
          "rhyme": ")k",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Every time he thinks his third eye blinks",
          "rhyme": ")k",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "It must be in the blood like zinc",
          "rhyme": ")g",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "Glassy-eyed V put your CD on jinx",
          "rhyme": ")ks",
          "persona_id": "Viktor_Vaughn"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABBBBBBBCDDEDEEEDDFG",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AAAAAAAABBBCBCCCBBBB"
    }
  ]
